            <profile id="28b4-9ce0-a09f-c450" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Special character. Armed with a Green Crescent moon halberd (counts as a heavy halberd), lamellar armour and horse (free, M8). Army Standard Bearer. Heroic Combat. Warrior of Legend. Sworn Brotherhood - Second Brother. Quality: Courage - any unit or character within 6" of Guan Yu at the Combat Resolution phase becomes Stubborn for that turn. 0-1. (The Art of War p.119)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="ddd6-4cd0-bd27-6a94" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
