            <profile id="1b53-bd5d-5181-099f" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Special character. Armed with an 18-span Serpent Headed Spear (counts as a kontos), lamellar armour and horse (free, M8). Army Standard Bearer. Heroic Combat. Warrior of Legend. Sworn Brotherhood - Third Brother. Quality: Impetuous. 0-1. The Brotherhood of the Peach Garden (Liu Bei, Guan Yu, Zhang Fei) must fight on the same side; taken together the First Brother is Army General, the Second the Army Standard Bearer and the Third a Champion; see the book. (The Art of War p.119)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="cd41-2c01-d541-2a34" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">None</characteristic>
