            <profile id="8a48-af6c-08fd-847a" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Special character. Armed with a crescent moon halberd (counts as a heavy halberd), lamellar armour and horse (free, M8). Army General. Heroic Combat. Warrior of Legend. Military Strategist. Quality: Guile - he may counteract any one Ruse per game before a player attempts their Leadership roll; may roll an additional D6 when fleeing. 0-1. (The Art of War p.119)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="7c21-dcf9-fbe8-128e" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
