                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with horse crossbows and improvised weapons. May have light armour (+2 pts). Light Cavalry. The horse crossbow has a range of 24", Strength 3 and a -1 save modifier; if they move in their Movement phase they are unable to fire that turn. (The Art of War p.117)</characteristic>
