              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon and shield. May have light armour (+2 pts) and upgrade to large shield (+1 pt). May have double-handed sword instead of hand weapon and shield for no extra cost. Light Infantry. (The Art of War p.118)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
